From e580571eace42f8e46dfbbed671ce25f23f129c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NEXUS sandbox <claude@sandbox.local>
Date: Sun, 31 May 2026 21:23:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: reconcile catalog to 98 titles, add voice title-intent,
 remove Fly.io

Catalog integrity:
- Restore 17 orphaned flagship titles (Severance, Dune, Parasite, etc.)
- Single source of truth: scripts/export_catalog.py -> frontend/src/data/catalog.js
- App.jsx imports generated catalog instead of inline 18-item MOCK_CONTENT
- AskNexus: findTitleMatch routes named titles to open-confirmation
- Fix '81 titles' labels -> 98
- Add CATALOG_INTEGRITY.md knowledge-base doc

Fly.io removal / Dockerfile consolidation:
- Delete fly.toml (abandoned) and Dockerfile.fly (duplicate of api/Dockerfile)
- Repoint docker-compose api + seeder builds to api/Dockerfile (context ./api)
- Fix README Dockerfile reference
